---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../../components/PageHead.astro';
import ProgramList from '../../components/ProgramList.astro';
import { getPrograms } from '../../lib/programs';
const summits = (await getPrograms()).filter((p) => p.kind === 'summit');
---
<Base title="HIVE JAPAN Summit" hero>
  <PageHead kicker="Summit" title="HIVE JAPAN Summit" />
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>「未来を創る志士たち」となる若者を対象にした、1泊2日の合宿型イベント。毎年、千葉県の Sport &amp; Do Resort リソルの森に全国から志ある若者が集い、「日本の未来」について語り合います。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="list">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ProgramList items={summits} big="year" />
      <a class="side" href="/regional/">Regional Summits も見る →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .intro { padding:88px 0 40px; }
  .intro p { margin:0; max-width:720px; font-size:1.06rem; line-height:2.1; }
  .list { padding:24px 0 130px; }
  .side { display:inline-block; margin-top:40px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--navy-700); text-decoration:none; }
  .side:hover { text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:4px; }
</style>
